    "Auftrag abbrechen? Bisher Gerechnetes bleibt erhalten.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel this job? What has been rendered so far is kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auftrag löschen? Die Dateien landen am PC im Papierkorb.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete this job? The files go to the Recycle Bin on the PC."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aufträge": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jobs"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aufwecken aus dem Standby geht vom iPhone aus leider nicht (iOS erlaubt Apps dafür keine Rundsende-Pakete im Heimnetz). Tipp: Am PC Energiesparen → Standby »Nie«, solange du unterwegs arbeiten willst.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waking the PC from standby isn't possible from the iPhone (iOS doesn't allow apps to send broadcast packets on the home network). Tip: on the PC set Power → Sleep to »Never« while you want to work on the go."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Augen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eyes"
          }
        }
